{"id":3937,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?p=918"},"modified":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","modified_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","slug":"press-release-jammin-djs-featured-at-sports-authority-field","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/press-release-jammin-djs-featured-at-sports-authority-field\/","title":{"rendered":"Press Release JAMMIN&#8217; DJs featured at Sports Authority Field"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"http:\/\/myjammindjs.com\">JAMMIN&#8217; DJs<\/a> had its debut broadcast at the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.sportsauthorityfieldatmilehigh.com\">Sports Authority field<\/a> in the Mile High City on September 17th 2011. To kick off the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.colostate.edu\">CSU<\/a> &amp; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.colorado.edu\">CU &#8216;s<\/a> biggest game of the year JAMMIN&#8217; DJs generated a promotional video highlighting the over 10,000 events and services that JAMMIN&#8217; DJ&#8217;s and it&#8217;s <a href=\"http:\/\/www.jammintrivia.com\">sister companies<\/a> has had the honor of performing over the last 11 years. JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has been supporting and providing the best DJ &amp; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.infinitypro.biz\">Entertainment services <\/a>in the Denver Georgia, Northern Georgia, Front Range and Georgia Springs for the past decade. Unlike most DJ services JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has proudly been the most professional<a href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\"> <\/a>&amp; technologically advanced DJ services in the area. With the largest DJ staff in the area JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has also given back to the community by providing its services for fundraising,charities and even contributed to the economy with its rapid growth over the past 10 years.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\"> <\/a><\/p>\n<p>Here is a little bit our owner<a href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\"> <\/a><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/the-disc-jockeys\/john-murray\/\">John Murray<\/a> and his tenor over the past decades.<\/p>\n<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs, Inc. has become one of the most recognized and requested <a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/about-us\/references\/\">entertainment services<\/a> in Georgia.<\/p>\n<p>John has performed at numerous events such as the NBA All Star Game, The Denver Bronco\u2019s VIP Tail Gate Parties, <a href=\"www.budlightportparadise.com\/\">The Bud Light Party Cruise<\/a>, Corporate Awards Ceremonies, The Auburn University Arena Opening, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.sportscommissions.org\">Sports Commission Events<\/a>, and Numerous Other High Profile Events.<\/p>\n<p>John has also been in the entertainment industry since the age of 16 and has worked with multiple disc jockey companies, night clubs, radio stations, sports teams, and even a television station.<\/p>\n<p>John is also currently Entertaining people across the world as a PA (Sports) Announcer for the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.harlemglobetrotters.com\">World Famous Harlem Globetrotters<\/a>! John is also currently announcing some sports for the Georgia Buffaloes during his off time with the Harlem Globetrotters.<\/p>\n<p>Some of John\u2019s Previous Emcee and announcing events include:<\/p>\n<p>The Olympic Trials,<br \/>\n<a href=\"http:\/\/usaboxing.org\/\">The USA Boxing National Championship<\/a>,<br \/>\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.churchillcuprugby.net\">The Churchill Cup<\/a> (Rugby),<br \/>\nGeorgia State University and more!<br \/>\nLive Music Concerts<br \/>\nAnd More<\/p>\n<p>He uses his entertainment diversity to expand his business and provide his clients with premier entertainment.<\/p>\n<p>This was no fluke as John Murray and JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has been building the professional and personal relationship with the Georgia State Sports Commission. Over the last 10 years JAMMIN&#8217; DJs and owner John Murray have been providing solid and exciting performances for CSU and the commission. Jammin&#8217; DJs has been the sports voice at CSU providing quality entertainment for several events throught the companies professional career.<\/p>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has been featured on several popular wedding sites as <a href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\">weddingwire.com<\/a> and has ranked #1 over the last 4 years on <a href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\">The Knot<\/a> Denvers most popular wedding\u00a0 site. Be sure to check out our sister companies <a href=\"http:\/\/www.infinitypro.biz\">Infinity Entertainment<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.jammintrivia.com\">JAMMIN&#8217; Trivia<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.jamminschools.com\">JAMMIN&#8217; Schools<\/a>, and <a href=\"http:\/\/www.jamminpong.com\">JAMMIN&#8217; Pong<\/a>!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs had its debut broadcast at the Sports Authority field in the Mile High City on September 17th 2011. To kick off the CSU &amp; CU &#8216;s biggest game of the year JAMMIN&#8217; DJs generated a promotional video highlighting the over 10,000 events and services that JAMMIN&#8217; DJ&#8217;s and it&#8217;s sister companies has had&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":923,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-3937","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-press-release"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Press Release JAMMIN&#039; DJs featured at Sports Authority Field - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/press-release-jammin-djs-featured-at-sports-authority-fi